plain-alias-error-message

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Fill the deprecated AliasError msg field from the plain message path instead of Display. Display runs the snippet renderer, so the to_string call linked annotate-snippets into every binary that deserializes YAML with aliases.
Upstream-Status: not-submitted
Drop-When: Upstream serde-saphyr stops calling Display when it wraps an error in AliasError.
